{"id":"e5558885fabd8e01","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-abstract-logic.md","title":"Regular Abstract Logics over First-Order Structures","display":"df-abstract-logic — Regular Abstract Logics over First-Order Structures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-abstract-logic","aliases":["67-df-abstract-logic"],"display":"df-abstract-logic — Regular Abstract Logics over First-Order Structures","depends_on":["[[67-df-satisfaction]]","[[67-df-isomorphism]]","[[67-df-syntax-interface]]"],"revision_status":"locally-revised","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","source_proof_status":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明","input_verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","input_source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-abstract-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-abstract-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abstract-logic — Regular Abstract Logics over First-Order Structures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc53ba723358facc\" href=\"?note=bc53ba723358facc\" title=\"67-df-satisfaction\">67-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa449de50b1c012\" href=\"?note=2aa449de50b1c012\" title=\"67-df-isomorphism\">67-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 遍历集合大小的一阶签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\)</span>、约化、同构与一阶满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc53ba723358facc\" href=\"?note=bc53ba723358facc\" title=\"67-df-satisfaction\">67-df-satisfaction</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2aa449de50b1c012\" href=\"?note=2aa449de50b1c012\" title=\"67-df-isomorphism\">67-df-isomorphism</a>。关于所有签名、结构的量化在元理论中进行。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>候选逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 指定集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 及二元类关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 是集合，而所有结构不被假定为一个集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\sigma\\cong\\tau\">\\(\\rho:\\sigma\\cong\\tau\\)</span> 是保元数的符号双射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_*\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\rho_*\\mathfrak M\\)</span> 将每个符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的解释赋给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(s)\">\\(\\rho(s)\\)</span>。候选逻辑还指定重命名映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_*\">\\(\\rho_*\\)</span>、句子运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{\\mathcal L},\\land_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\neg_{\\mathcal L},\\land_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、消去新常元运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_c\">\\(E_c\\)</span> 和一元谓词相对化运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_P\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_P\\)</span>。它们的类型及真值条件在下式给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\sigma\\)</span> 是丢弃签名外符号的约化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M[c\\mapsto a]\">\\(\\mathfrak M[c\\mapsto a]\\)</span> 是新常元扩张。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subdom}_\\sigma(\\mathfrak M,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subdom}_\\sigma(\\mathfrak M,A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright A\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright A\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2aa449de50b1c012\" href=\"?note=2aa449de50b1c012\" title=\"67-df-isomorphism\">67-df-isomorphism</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFO}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegFO}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}\">\\(\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}\\)</span> 是下式定义的谓词；不以未列明的“标准正则性”作为前提。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau\">\\(\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubSig}(\\sigma,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{SubSig}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\sigma\\cong\\tau\">\\(\\rho:\\sigma\\cong\\tau\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,\\sigma,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,\\sigma,\\tau)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\sigma|=|F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma|\">\\(|\\sigma|=|F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma|\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\}=\\sigma\\oplus_F(\\{c\\},\\{(c,0)\\})\">\\(\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\}=\\sigma\\oplus_F(\\{c\\},\\{(c,0)\\})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\}=\\sigma\\oplus_R(\\{P\\},\\{(P,1)\\})\">\\(\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\}=\\sigma\\oplus_R(\\{P\\},\\{(P,1)\\})\\)</span>。这些记号均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3f06c9fe86c236dd\" href=\"?note=3f06c9fe86c236dd\" title=\"67-df-syntax-interface\">67-df-syntax-interface</a>；结构操作取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2aa449de50b1c012\" href=\"?note=2aa449de50b1c012\" title=\"67-df-isomorphism\">67-df-isomorphism</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dom}_P(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Dom}_P(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span> 是下式定义的一元关系载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a\\rangle\\)</span> 是长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的元组。其参数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in R_\\tau\">\\(P\\in R_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_\\tau(P)=1\">\\(a_\\tau(P)=1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dom}_P(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\n\\{a\\in|\\mathfrak M|:\\langle a\\rangle\\in P^{\\mathfrak M}\\}\n\\qquad(\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau,\\ P\\in R_\\tau,\\ a_\\tau(P)=1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dom}_P(\\mathfrak M)\\coloneqq\n\\{a\\in|\\mathfrak M|:\\langle a\\rangle\\in P^{\\mathfrak M}\\}\n\\qquad(\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau,\\ P\\in R_\\tau,\\ a_\\tau(P)=1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\n\\forall\\sigma\\ \\bigl[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\n\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\sigma\\\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_\\sigma\\varphi)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n(\\mathfrak M\\cong_\\sigma\\mathfrak N\\Longrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\tau\\ (\\operatorname{SubSig}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\Longrightarrow\\ \\bigl[\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\tau)\n\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\tau}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\sigma\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi)\\bigr])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\ \\exists\\sigma_0\\subseteq\\sigma\\\n(|\\sigma_0|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma_0))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\tau\\forall\\rho:\\sigma\\cong\\tau\\ \\bigl[\\rho_*:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\tau)\n\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n(\\rho_*\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\tau}\\rho_*\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\ \\bigl[\\neg_{\\mathcal L}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\n\\land\\land_{\\mathcal L}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)^2\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n\\bigl[(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\neg_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}(\\varphi\\land_{\\mathcal L}\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\psi))\\bigr]\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall c\\notin F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma\\ \\bigl[E_c:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\})\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\})\\\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}E_c\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\ (\\mathfrak M[c\\mapsto a]\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\}}\\varphi))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall P\\notin F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{Rel}_P:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_{\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\}}\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Subdom}_\\sigma(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\sigma,\\operatorname{Dom}_P(\\mathfrak M))\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\}}\\operatorname{Rel}_P\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\sigma)\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Dom}_P(\\mathfrak M)\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi)\\bigr]\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathcal L\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\sigma\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_\\sigma\\psi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\n\\forall\\sigma\\ \\bigl[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\n\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\sigma\\\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_\\sigma\\varphi)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n(\\mathfrak M\\cong_\\sigma\\mathfrak N\\Longrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak N\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\tau\\ (\\operatorname{SubSig}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\Longrightarrow\\ \\bigl[\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\tau)\n\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\tau\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\tau}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\sigma\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi)\\bigr])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\ \\exists\\sigma_0\\subseteq\\sigma\\\n(|\\sigma_0|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma_0))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\tau\\forall\\rho:\\sigma\\cong\\tau\\ \\bigl[\\rho_*:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\tau)\n\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n(\\rho_*\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\tau}\\rho_*\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\ \\bigl[\\neg_{\\mathcal L}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\n\\land\\land_{\\mathcal L}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)^2\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n\\bigl[(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\neg_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}(\\varphi\\land_{\\mathcal L}\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\psi))\\bigr]\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall c\\notin F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma\\ \\bigl[E_c:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\})\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\})\\\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}E_c\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\ (\\mathfrak M[c\\mapsto a]\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\}}\\varphi))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\forall P\\notin F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{Rel}_P:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_{\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\}}\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Subdom}_\\sigma(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\sigma,\\operatorname{Dom}_P(\\mathfrak M))\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\}}\\operatorname{Rel}_P\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\sigma)\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Dom}_P(\\mathfrak M)\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi)\\bigr]\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathcal L\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\sigma\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\\n(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_\\sigma\\psi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条补齐原有第57册链接承担的逻辑接口。有限出现、重命名、布尔运算、存在量化与相对化分别有显式条件；单有一个句子集和满足关系并不自动满足这些条件。</p>\n<p>一元关系的解释是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak M|^1\">\\(|\\mathfrak M|^1\\)</span> 的子集；诱导子结构所需的载体由前两节的投影定义给出，不再将一元组与其分量默认为同一对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"bc53ba723358facc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2aa449de50b1c012","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"bc53ba723358facc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau$ 遍历集合大小的一阶签名；$\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma$、约化、同构与一阶满足关系取 [[67-df-satisfaction]]、[[67-df-isomorphism]]。关于所有签名、结构的量化在元理论中进行。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2aa449de50b1c012","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau$ 遍历集合大小的一阶签名；$\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma$、约化、同构与一阶满足关系取 [[67-df-satisfaction]]、[[67-df-isomorphism]]。关于所有签名、结构的量化在元理论中进行。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2aa449de50b1c012","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\sigma$ 是丢弃签名外符号的约化；$\\mathfrak M[c\\mapsto a]$ 是新常元扩张。$\\operatorname{Subdom}_\\sigma(\\mathfrak M,A)$ 与 $\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright A$ 取 [[67-df-isomorphism]]。$\\mathrm{RegFO}$、$\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}$ 是下式定义的谓词；不以未列明的“标准正则性”作为前提。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau$ 缩写 $\\operatorname{SubSig}(\\sigma,\\tau)$，$\\rho:\\sigma\\cong\\tau$ 缩写 $\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,\\sigma,\\tau)$；$|\\sigma|=|F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma|$。$\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\}=\\sigma\\oplus_F(\\{c\\},\\{(c,0)\\})$，$\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\}=\\sigma\\oplus_R(\\{P\\},\\{(P,1)\\})$。这些记号均取 [[67-df-syntax-interface]]；结构操作取 [[67-df-isomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2aa449de50b1c012","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau$ 缩写 $\\operatorname{SubSig}(\\sigma,\\tau)$，$\\rho:\\sigma\\cong\\tau$ 缩写 $\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,\\sigma,\\tau)$；$|\\sigma|=|F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma|$。$\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\}=\\sigma\\oplus_F(\\{c\\},\\{(c,0)\\})$，$\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\}=\\sigma\\op